; Thief2VR: hides the first-person arm and hand, so only the sword shows in VR
; (held by your controller). swhand.png is the original texture atlas with
; everything but the sword strip (left edge: hilt wrap + blade) made
; transparent. Alpha keying discards those pixels instead of blending them, so
; the invisible arm doesn't hide the sword through the depth buffer.
force_alpha_key 1
